{"id":"prepositions-0163","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 163","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"after","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Could you look ___ my plants while I\u0027m away?","hint":"look ___ = take care of","explanation":"look AFTER somebody/something = take care of them."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I\u0027m looking ___ my keys \u2014 have you seen them?","hint":"look ___ = search","explanation":"look FOR = try to find."},{"answer":"at","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She glanced ___ her watch and stood up.","hint":"glance ___ sth","explanation":"glance AT = look quickly at."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She blamed the delay ___ the courier company.","hint":"blame sth ___ sb","explanation":"blame something ON somebody = blame somebody FOR something."},{"answer":"on","accept":["upon"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Our picnic depends ___ the weather.","hint":"depend ___","explanation":"depend ON (upon in formal style)."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I\u0027m still waiting for a reply ___ my complaint.","hint":"reply ___ sth","explanation":"a reply TO a letter/complaint/question."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She\u0027s very fond ___ her nieces.","hint":"fond ___ sb/sth","explanation":"fond OF somebody/something."},{"answer":"at","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She smiled ___ the waiter and ordered tea.","hint":"smile ___ sb","explanation":"smile AT somebody."}]}